flowchart TD
    ui["Buyer / merchant UI<br/>React + TypeScript<br/>AG Studio + Bryntum"]
    edge["Managed edge + identity<br/>CDN / WAF / OIDC / quotas"]
    evidence["Evidence and AI preparation<br/>Channel3 / Astropods / Kernel / Elastic<br/>scoped proposals; no payment authority"]
    pp["PayPal<br/>buyer approval / capture / verification"]
    task["Approved setup task<br/>Zapier; after verified payment"]
    qa["Isolated Counterexample<br/>APIMatic development context<br/>Postman independent regressions"]
    app["One FastAPI application on Render<br/>Assembly checks + PayGuard authority<br/>versioned offers / approvals / webhook ingress"]
    sql["Managed PostgreSQL<br/>primary + synchronous AZ standby<br/>purchases / reservations / inbox / outbox"]
    worker["One worker service on Render<br/>separate bounded job pools<br/>payment dispatch / reconciliation / follow-through"]
    ui --> edge
    edge --> app
    app -->|short transactions| sql
    app -->|prepare| evidence
    sql -.->|durable jobs| worker
    worker -->|stable operation identity| pp
    pp -.->|signed webhook| app
    worker -->|confirmed / unknown outcome| sql
    worker -.->|explicit consent| task
    qa -.->|owned test environment| app
